---
// Consistent, accessible styling for pre-launch TODO markers. Solid
// sun-600 background with ink text passes contrast (~4.7:1) regardless
// of the surrounding section's background, so it works everywhere.
---

<span class="inline-block rounded bg-sun-600 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-body font-medium text-ink">
  <slot />
</span>
